justification.md
  # Budget Office PC - Justification

## CPU
The Intel Core i3-12100 was selected because it offers excellent office performance at a low price. 
Its 4 cores and high single-core speed are ideal for document work, web browsing, and multitasking.

### Alternative Component
Intel Core i3-14100 was considered as an alternative because it offers slightly better performance and newer architecture.

### Future Upgrade
A future upgrade to Intel Core i5-14400 would improve multitasking and productivity performance.

---

## Motherboard
The MSI PRO B760M-P DDR4 motherboard was selected because it supports modern Intel processors and DDR4 memory.
It also provides enough connectivity for office use and future storage upgrades.

### Alternative Component
Gigabyte B760M D3HP WIFI6 offers integrated WiFi and additional connectivity features.

### Future Upgrade
A higher-end B760 motherboard with more M.2 slots can be added in the future.

---

## RAM
16GB DDR4 memory was selected because it is sufficient for office applications and multitasking.
The 3200MHz speed provides stable and responsive system performance.

### Alternative Component
Kingston Fury Beast 2x8GB DDR4 3200MHz provides similar performance with dual-channel configuration.

### Future Upgrade
Upgrading to 32GB RAM would improve performance for heavier workloads.

---

## Storage
The Lexar NM620 512GB NVMe SSD was selected because it provides fast boot times and quick file access.
It is suitable for office software and everyday use.

### Alternative Component
Gigabyte 4000E 500GB SSD offers similar storage capacity and NVMe performance.

### Future Upgrade
A 1TB NVMe SSD could be added for additional storage space.

---

## Power Supply
The Gigabyte P450B 450W PSU was selected because it provides enough power for the system while maintaining efficiency.

### Alternative Component
Corsair CX550 offers higher wattage and improved reliability.

### Future Upgrade
A 550W or 650W PSU may be needed if a dedicated GPU is added later.

---

## Monitor
The MSI PRO MP251 monitor was selected because of its IPS panel and 100Hz refresh rate.
It provides comfortable viewing angles and smooth image quality for office work.

### Alternative Component
ViewSonic VA2432-MHD-3 provides similar image quality and refresh rate.

### Future Upgrade
A 27-inch QHD monitor would improve workspace and productivity.

